                <pb facs="0812" n="706" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg706"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Ambassador Reid.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-12-04"><hi rendition="#italic">December 4,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Department is informed by Alexander that he has heard reports of one American
                    vessel fishing on Sunday. Department will advise Mr. Reid if report is found to
                    be true. In the meantime strictest injunction has been repeated against any such
                    fishing.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
